    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. that makes sense. one more thing—could you write a short paragraph for the memo that summarizes the risk profile for both? i want to make sure the client understands how these 'hidden' costs or trading discrepancies could unexpectedly impact their returns. just keep it professional and direct.",
